  {
   "address": 29696,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "LEVELF sprite slots for VIC pointers $D0\u2013$DB in bank $4000. Each slot has 63 pixel bytes followed by a byte outside the VIC's sprite fetch."
  },
  {
   "address": 30464,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Translate each of LEVELF's 256 character indices to a colour byte for the viewport renderer at $131B."
  },
  {
   "address": 30720,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The first 128 glyphs for LEVELF. The IRQ at $0C84 selects the 2 KB character set with $D018 = $0E while VIC bank $4000 is selected."
  },
  {
   "address": 30936,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The low page of the playfield character set continues here, starting at glyph $1B. The VIC reads eight pattern bytes per glyph."
  },
  {
